@startuml

title Fluxo Importante - Consulta de Tickets (Lista e Detalhe)

autoactivate on

actor User
participant "Frontend\n/tickets" as FEList
participant "Frontend\n/tickets/{id}" as FEDetail
participant "Backend API\n/tickets" as API
participant "TicketService" as Service
participant "TicketRepository" as Repo
database "SQLite\n(tickets.db)" as DB

User -> FEList: Acessa lista de tickets
FEList -> API: GET /tickets
API -> Service: get_tickets()
Service -> Repo: get_tickets()
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM tickets
DB --> Repo: rows
Repo --> Service: tickets
Service --> API: tickets
API --> FEList: 200 OK + lista

User -> FEDetail: Clica em um ticket
FEDetail -> API: GET /tickets/{id}
API -> Service: get_ticket_by_id(id)
Service -> Repo: get_ticket_by_id(id)
Repo -> DB: SELECT ticket by id
DB --> Repo: ticket/null
Repo --> Service: ticket/null

alt ticket encontrado
  Service --> API: ticket
  API --> FEDetail: 200 OK + detalhe
else ticket nao encontrado
  Service --> API: TicketNotFoundException
  API --> FEDetail: 404 Not Found
end

@enduml
